# 各模块自己的忽略规则写在模块目录下（例如 room-reconstruction/.gitignore）。这里只放全仓库通用的。

# 密钥
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 环境和缓存
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
node_modules/
gesture/docs/DEV_HISTORY.md

# 系统文件
.DS_Store

# Local GPU server environments, sources and model weights
/runtime/
# serve.py 缓存的已完成房间和重建回放（runs/room-cache/）
/runs/
/backends/

# 示例房间的模型是 sample-rooms release 的附件（清单 samples/models.json），用 scripts/fetch_samples.py 获取
/samples/*/Room.glb
/samples/*/Room.glb.part

# Local room list removals
.roomcanvas/

# Local build, validation and delivery artifacts
/tmp/
/output/
/docs/latex/**/.build/
/docs/latex/**/*.aux
/docs/latex/**/*.log
/docs/latex/**/*.out
/docs/latex/**/*.toc
/docs/latex/**/*.pdf
/docs/latex/**/*.synctex*
/docs/latex/**/*.fdb_latexmk
/docs/latex/**/*.fls
/docs/latex/**/*.xdv

# Personal reports and their screenshots stay local.
/.vscode/settings.json
/docs/GESTURE_REPORT.md
/docs/UI_OPERATION_REPORT.md
/docs/images/gesture-report/
/docs/images/ui-operation-report/
/docs/latex/gesture-report/
/docs/latex/ui-operation-report/
/scripts/build_gesture_report.py
/scripts/build_ui_report.py
